WEBVTT

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:03.280
and drowns us in false uniformity
to protect the status quo.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:09.896
Notice, everybody,
I said culture of whiteness,

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:11.976
and not white people.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.976
Because in my estimation,

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:17.120
the problem is not white people.

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:21.560
Instead, it is the culture of whiteness.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:23.696
And by culture of whiteness,

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:29.696
I mean a systemic and organized
set of beliefs,

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:36.200
values, canonized knowledge
and even religion,